ArctOS for the Xiaomi Redmi Note 8T is a collection with mixed licenses:

- patches/kernel/*, drivers/*, dts/*  : GPL-2.0-only (same as the Linux kernel)
- patches/phosh/*                     : GPL-3.0-or-later (same as Phosh)
- everything else (tools, scripts, rootfs configs, theme code, wallpapers): GPL-3.0-or-later
- generated icons: CC BY-SA 3.0 (they include Adwaita symbolic glyphs)

Full texts: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html , https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html ,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Proprietary Qualcomm/Xiaomi firmware is NOT included and NOT redistributed.
See docs/CREDITS.md.
